# 3. CORE INNOVATION — THE LEARNSPHERE LEARNING LOOP

The central innovation is a continuous learning cycle:

ASSESS → UNDERSTAND → ADAPT → LEARN → PRACTISE → SAVE OFFLINE → SYNC → IMPROVE.

Implement this as the main product experience.

A student should be able to:

1. Enter the platform.
2. Select their grade and subject.
3. Complete a short diagnostic assessment.
4. Receive a topic-wise performance analysis.
5. See which concepts need improvement.
6. Receive a personalised lesson recommendation.
7. Study the recommended lesson.
8. Complete a practice quiz with an appropriate difficulty level.
9. Save progress while offline.
10. Synchronise pending progress when connectivity returns.

This complete journey must actually work in the application.

Do not merely display this flow as a graphic. Implement it.

